    "updated_at": "2021-06-08T06:00:28Z",
    "body": "938cb06 is a strawman sketch of proxy support. Surprisingly little of RFC6455 section 4.1 step 3 seems to actually be needed.\r\n\r\nThe \"total pending proxy WebSocket connections\" map is fiction, but I don't want to standardise Chromium's embarrassing behaviour. I would be interested to learn what other browsers do here.",
