    "created_at": "2021-06-08T06:17:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-08T06:17:40Z",
    "body": "Upon further investigation, it appears that Chromium doesn't always convert \"ws\" and \"wss\" to \"http\" and \"https\" when executing proxy.pac. It depends on whether we're using the system implementation of proxy resolution or not. Maybe it needs to be implementation-defined.",
